### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/system/health

### Todas las entidades
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities

### Solo personas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities?type=PERSON

### Buscar por nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities?name=mart

### Detalle de entidad
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities/1

### Contactos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities/5/contacts

### Relaciones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities/5/relations

### Cuentas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entities/5/accounts

### Calendarios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendars

### Eventos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendars/2/events

### Solicitudes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests

### Crear solicitud (ajusta IDs a los de tu BD)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestTypeCode": "GENERAL_QUERY",
  "subject": "Consulta de prueba desde API",
  "description": "Solicitud creada desde VS Code / Swagger",
  "createdByEntityId": 5,
  "participants": [
    {
      "entityId": 5,
      "role": "REQUESTER"
    },
    {
      "entityId": 1,
      "role": "RECIPIENT"
    }
  ]
}
